# Credential shapes, beside the `.env` above (#567).
# Every one of these was checked with `git ls-files` at landing time and
# matched nothing tracked — the widening cannot hide existing content.
# Each pattern also narrows what `scripts/smoke/audit.sh`'s untracked-surface
# scan can report under a mapped prefix (#564); that trade is deliberate,
# because a credential landing in the working tree is the worse outcome.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
.npmrc
secrets.json
